+    // usual host is a frame (no DIALOG_SHIM final validation there),
+    // and its FinishSetup restore runs at ctor size, so this timer --
+    // firing in the host's event loop at the final size -- is the
+    // authoritative sash validation; healed values are written back
+    // so the destructor's save re-banks them. The preview is then
+    // re-displayed through the preview panel directly, bypassing
+    // FOOTPRINT_PREVIEW_WIDGET's already-displayed cache: a first
+    // paint dropped into a zero-sized or collapsed canvas would
+    // otherwise never be retried for the same footprint.
